\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Help Complete La Biblia Fiel\'92s First Official Edition\
I am raising funds to complete the translation and word-level alignment of La Biblia Fiel\'97a Spanish Bible being developed for careful study and free digital access.\
This project began with a practical need. While researching and studying Scripture, I searched for a Spanish Bible that combined the translation approach, original-language connections, accessibility, and study tools I needed. That experience led me to begin developing La Biblia Fiel.\
My aim is to preserve the meaning, structure, repetition, and meaningful distinctions of the biblical languages as faithfully as understandable Spanish allows. Translation requires judgment, and I want those decisions to be handled carefully and transparently.\
Alongside the translation, I am developing detailed connections between Spanish words and phrases and their corresponding words in the original languages. This alignment provides a foundation for reverse-interlinear study, original-language searches, concordances, and grammatical analysis.\
The project is already underway. You can explore the current work here:\
