The published text remains a work in progress. My workflow includes AI-assisted drafting and checking tools, with human review and approval required before work is considered complete.\
Your contribution will support the time needed to:\
\'95 Complete and revise the translation.\uc0\u8232 \'95 Develop and check the word-level alignment.\u8232 \'95 Review the translation and alignment together for the first official edition.\
I currently lead this project myself from Canada. Funds will be received by me personally and used to support this work. This is a personal fundraiser, and charitable donation tax receipts will not be issued.\
My goal is to make the completed edition freely accessible in digital form, including to readers who cannot afford paid Bible-study resources. I plan to share regular progress updates so supporters can follow the work toward completion.\
Thank you for helping make this resource available to Spanish-speaking readers.\
